WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.283 --> 00:00:01.492
- I'm terrified.

00:00:01.492 --> 00:00:04.162
- I'm looking to really
learn what it's all about.

00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:05.697
This is kinda all I know.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.962
- We are introducing
Bollywood dance to Americans

00:00:11.962 --> 00:00:14.806
who have never experienced
Bollywood before.

00:00:21.596 --> 00:00:22.931
- I want all off the face,

00:00:22.931 --> 00:00:24.641
tons and tons of energy and drama.

00:00:24.641 --> 00:00:25.392
I don't care about anything else.

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:26.811
Even if you've never one this before,

00:00:26.811 --> 00:00:28.187
I don't want to see it on your face.

00:00:28.187 --> 00:00:29.688
I want your face to be like...

00:00:29.688 --> 00:00:31.148
I got this, the whole time, okay?

00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:32.314
So I expect people to come in

00:00:32.314 --> 00:00:34.401
with a fair amount of trepidation.

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:36.236
Usually people are a little
bit nervous to try it

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:39.030
because it looks so dramatic
and big and exciting,

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:40.657
and sometimes cheesy.

00:00:40.657 --> 00:00:42.431
As soon as we jump into it, I think

00:00:42.431 --> 00:00:43.577
with me screaming and yelling at them,

00:00:43.577 --> 00:00:45.120
they'll forget all about
it and just be able to

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.431
jump in and learn the moves.

00:00:47.431 --> 00:00:51.334
Good, so that's your basic
and that's your step-touches.

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:53.463
Thumb, index, middle, ring, pinky.

00:00:53.463 --> 00:00:54.588
- It was so many emotions.

00:00:54.588 --> 00:00:56.298
It was like, sexy face,
happy face, sexy face,

00:00:56.298 --> 00:00:58.794
serious, sexy, happy,
sexy, happy, it was--

00:00:58.794 --> 00:01:00.511
- But overall sexy angry,

00:01:00.511 --> 00:01:03.026
like sexy goes before
every other adjective.

00:01:03.026 --> 00:01:05.348
- Okay, so now we're
going to have my dancers,

00:01:05.348 --> 00:01:07.279
my beautiful professional dancers come out

00:01:07.279 --> 00:01:09.010
in their costumes, and we're going to show

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.448
the new dancers exactly what the combo's

00:01:11.448 --> 00:01:13.805
supposed to look like with costumes.

00:01:13.805 --> 00:01:18.805
(upbeat Indian music)

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:23.458
(cheering)

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:26.295
- So are you ready to do it like that?

00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:28.163
Let's get you in your costumes,
put some bindis on you,

00:01:28.163 --> 00:01:30.624
get some ankle bells on the
girls, some kurtas on the boys.

00:01:30.624 --> 00:01:32.042
Come on, let's go!

00:01:32.042 --> 00:01:34.252
- [Man] It's a different
type of exercise, I think.

00:01:34.252 --> 00:01:35.420
- [Woman] It's just fun.

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.556
For anyone who thinks they
can't dance, just do Bollywood.

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:39.425
It's just bouncing and just fun.

00:01:39.425 --> 00:01:41.634
- [blond woman] A lot of this.
- [woman in glasses] Yeah.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.121
- A lot of this.

00:01:45.044 --> 00:01:50.044
(upbeat music)

00:01:59.004 --> 00:02:00.321
- [Voiceover] It was so much fun!

00:02:00.321 --> 00:02:01.571
- [Voiceover] It was a blast!

00:02:01.571 --> 00:02:03.740
I had so much fun, oh my God.

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:06.451
- [Voiceover] I think it takes
a different type of control.

00:02:06.451 --> 00:02:07.893
- [Voiceover] Yeah, I'm
taking this to the club

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:10.181
Friday night and see how I fare.

00:02:13.991 --> 00:02:15.502
- [blond woman] It was intense, though.

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:17.420
- I feel like, even if you
don't really get the movements,

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.256
as long as you have the
energy and you're just

00:02:19.256 --> 00:02:20.062
bouncing all over the place--

00:02:20.062 --> 00:02:20.868
- Yeah.

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:21.675
- You'll get by.

00:02:21.675 --> 00:02:22.551
- [blond woman] You know.

00:02:22.551 --> 00:02:24.428
I feel like we could maybe be

00:02:24.428 --> 00:02:26.137
in the background of some Bollywood movie.

00:02:26.137 --> 00:02:27.055
- [woman in glasses] Exactly.
- [blond woman] And just do

00:02:27.055 --> 00:02:29.371
this and be like, yeah,
we do this for a living.

